      "title": "bthci_cmd/evt: Bluetooth HCI update to spec v6.0",
      "message": "bthci_cmd/evt: Bluetooth HCI update to spec v6.0\n\nDissection of HCI commands and events related to v6.0 features:\nChannel sounding, decision-based advertising filtering, monitoring\nadvertisers, enhanced ISOAL, LE extended features & frame space update.\nSlot to microsecond conversions changed to use custom format\nfunctions for most slot/slot-pair parameters.\n",
      "author_name": "Allan Møller Madsen",
